flowchart TD
    subgraph Phase1 ["1. EVENT CREATION & GOVERNANCE (Admin Only)"]
        A[Admin opens /admin/hackathons] --> B[Launch 5-Step Creation Wizard]
        B --> C[Step 1: Basic Info & Banner Upload]
        C --> D[Step 2: Dates, Schedule & Modes]
        D --> E[Step 3: Problem Statements, PDF Specs & Rubrics]
        E --> F[Step 4: Admission Policy, Fee & UPI QR Upload]
        F --> G[Step 5: Review & Publish Event]
        G --> H[(Persist Hackathon in MongoDB Atlas)]
    end

    subgraph Phase2 ["2. REGISTRATION & SQUAD FORMATION (Students)"]
        H --> I[Event visible on /hackathons]
        I --> J{Admission Mode?}
        J -->|Free Arena ₹0| K[Instant Registration Confirmed]
        J -->|Paid Arena ₹100| L[Student sees Fee Due & Custom UPI QR]
        L --> M[Student transfers fee & uploads payment proof]
        M --> N[(Registration saved: payment_under_review)]
        N --> O[Admin Audits & Verifies Payment]
        O --> P[(Registration marked: verified)]
        K --> Q[Student forms or joins Squad in /team or /recruitment]
        P --> Q
    end

    subgraph Phase3 ["3. PROBLEM DIRECTIVE LOCKING & WORKSPACE"]
        Q --> R[Squad reaches required quorum]
        R --> S{Problems Released?}
        S -->|Admin inspection| T[Admin clicks INSPECT DIRECTIVE -> View Dossier]
        S -->|Locked for participants| U[Countdown active: Problem unlock at zero]
        S -->|Unlocked / Live| V[Squad Leader selects Track Directive]
        V --> W[(Squad locked to problemId in MongoDB)]
        W --> X[Squad enters /workspace Kanban HUD]
    end

    subgraph Phase4 ["4. PAYLOAD TRANSMISSION & EVALUATION"]
        X --> Y[Squad builds solution & uploads submission payload]
        Y --> Z[(Submission record created with repo link & demo)]
        Z --> AA[Hackathon concludes -> Submissions locked]
        AA --> AB[Judges enter /evaluations matrix]
        AB --> AC[Grade submissions against configured Rubric weights]
        AC --> AD[(Grades persisted & composite scores calculated)]
    end

    subgraph Phase5 ["5. LEADERBOARD & CERTIFICATE DISPATCH"]
        AD --> AE[Publish results to /leaderboard]
        AE --> AF[Admin accesses /certificates console]
        AF --> AG[Admin uploads official certificate & commendation]
        AG --> AH[(Certificates saved in MongoDB with SHA-256 hash)]
        AH --> AI[Students download official certificates in /certificates]
    end
